            "review_title": "Review at Quán Cô Cúc",
            "review_text": "KnH1993\n28 contributions\n1\nYummy Vietnamese vegetarian food\nDec 2023 • Friends\nThis is a teeny tiny vegetarian restaurant that only has a few tables, most people buy to go. It has really tasty vegetarian pho that has a ton of mushrooms and herbs. They also have plant-based \"pork\" chops that a friend's son thought was real meat! Super cheap and clean, the pho and pork chop were only 35k each ($1.50). Highly recommend!\nWritten December 27, 2023",
